cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite Version 0.1.0 of this research repository."
title: "A symmetric Hadamard matrix of order 8740"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - family-names: Kline
    given-names: Jeffery
repository-code: "https://github.com/jeff-kline/symmetric-hadamard-8740"
url: "https://github.com/jeff-kline/symmetric-hadamard-8740"
license: GPL-3.0-only
abstract: >-
  A symmetric Hadamard matrix of order 8740 = 4·2185, an order listed as
  undecided in the 2025 Đoković–Seberry census. For every prime power
  q = 3 mod 4 with a symmetric Hadamard matrix of order q+5, the note gives
  symmetric Hadamard matrices of orders (q+1)(q+4)q^r for all r >= 0, by
  building field negation into each step of Seberry's 1980 recursion; Seberry
  obtained these orders for ordinary matrices and Kumar gave the symmetric case
  r = 0. At q = 19 this gives 460·19^r. The repository builds the matrix from
  its formula and checks it with two independent programs. Novelty is bounded
  to the sources searched.
keywords:
  - Hadamard matrices
  - symmetric Hadamard matrices
  - orthogonal designs
  - finite fields
references:
  - type: article
    title: "Some infinite classes of Hadamard matrices"
    authors:
